Package: honupsy
Title: Tools for Working with Routine Psychiatric Patient Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Ketzer", , "michael.ketzer@unibas.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9633-3947"))
Description: Provides functions to import, validate, and summarise data
    from the Swiss national quality measurement in adult inpatient
    psychiatry, implemented against the ANQ data definition for
    measurement year 2022 (MB, MP, PH, PB, and FM records).
